ORDERS ["Take Heavy Spark Charge from the pending level-up offer.","Hold the claim and clear the active north-edge threats before leaving the works exposed.","After the north pack breaks, pan gold-seam-2 at (-9, 6.7); keep the prospector near the claim.","At 25 gold, build the first Sentry Beacon on the north approach so its 8wu slow covers the route into the claim.","Save next for a Turret; place it behind the north beacon with clear line of sight.","Keep the existing Palisade between the north approach and the claim; replace it only if wrecked.","Before wave 20, establish beacon-and-turret coverage for all four spawn edges and preserve enough firepower to focus the Baron's Rocket Cart."]
